[**
 * The number of invariant operations of the classes that come before a class in a list.
 **/]
[query public invariantsBefore(genClasses : OclAny, genClass : GenClass) : Integer = if genClasses->isEmpty() or genClasses->first() = genClass then 0 else invariantOperations(genClasses->first())->size() + invariantsBefore(genClasses->drop(1), genClass) endif/]

[**
 * The number of invariant operations of the classes of a package.
 **/]
[query public invariantCount(genPackage : GenPackage) : Integer = genPackage.genClasses->collect(c | invariantOperations(c)->size())->sum()/]

[**
 * The type of the value of a data type or enumeration as the validator writes it.
 **/]
[template public valueTypeName(dataType : OclAny)][if (not dataType.ecoreEnum.oclIsUndefined())][importedName(dataType.qualifiedEnumName())/][else][importedName(objectTypeName(dataType.dataTypeClassName()))/][/if][/template]

[**
 * The type of the parameter of the validate method of a classifier.
 **/]
